  "goodToKnow": "Das Privateigentum is private property, protected by Article 14 of the Grundgesetz, which also states Eigentum verpflichtet: its use should serve the common good. Expropriation (Enteignung) is allowed only for the public good and with compensation. Legally, das Eigentum (ownership) differs from der Besitz (possession): a tenant has Besitz but not Eigentum. Signs saying Privatgrundstück mark private land. It has no plural."
